     3497             SIZE 9 BY .62 AT ROW 1.71 COL 4 WIDGET-ID 62
     3498             FGCOLOR 4
     3499        "Форма" VIEW-AS TEXT
     3500             SIZE 9 BY .62 AT ROW 2.67 COL 4 WIDGET-ID 64
