     5675       accumulate part-1.remain-21 (total).
     5676       accumulate part-1.remain-6  (total by part-1.alc-type-code).
     5677       accumulate part-1.inc-7     (total by part-1.alc-type-code).
     5678       accumulate part-1.inc-8     (total by part-1.alc-type-code).
     5679       accumulate part-1.inc-9     (total by part-1.alc-type-code).
     5680       accumulate part-1.inc-10    (total by part-1.alc-type-code).
     5681       accumulate part-1.inc-11    (total by part-1.alc-type-code).
     5682       accumulate part-1.inc-12    (total by part-1.alc-type-code).
     5683       accumulate part-1.inc-13    (total by part-1.alc-type-code).
     5684       accumulate part-1.inc-14    (total by part-1.alc-type-code).
     5685       accumulate part-1.exp-15    (total by part-1.alc-type-code).
     5686       accumulate part-1.exp-16    (total by part-1.alc-type-code).
     5687       accumulate part-1.exp-17    (total by part-1.alc-type-code).
     5688       accumulate part-1.exp-18    (total by part-1.alc-type-code).
