     5754       end.
     5755       accumulate part-1.remain-6  (total by part-1.obj-code).
     5756       accumulate part-1.inc-7     (total by part-1.obj-code).
     5757       accumulate part-1.inc-8     (total by part-1.obj-code).
     5758       accumulate part-1.inc-9     (total by part-1.obj-code).
