     5768       accumulate part-1.exp-19    (total by part-1.obj-code).
     5769       accumulate part-1.remain-20 (total by part-1.obj-code).
     5770       accumulate part-1.remain-21 (total by part-1.obj-code).
     5771       hSAXWriter:start-element ("row").
     5772           nn = nn + 1.
